# A card that fails does not hold up the ST: with a file named PRINTER where
# the RP wants its folder, no job can open. PRFILES still prints our ESC/P
# pages to the end, the RP answers every block (the hook drops nothing), and
# the bytes are lost on the RP's side, not the ST's: it says it cannot open
# the job, and nothing is on the card.
@disk-a tools/dev/builds/disks/escp.st
cardput PRINTER
text "Atari +: (ST|STE|Mega STE), TOS" 1500
key f
key 0x1c
wait 100
key 0x01
wait 900
key 0x39
hookdone 2938 3000
log "printer: cannot open /PRINTER/00000001.TMP" 100
wait 600
cardnone PRINTER/*.*
hookstate
